Date: Sat, 17 Oct 2026 06:11:36 -0700
Subject: [PATCH 068/220] [ae-patch] Render a pull request card's description
 as markdown

Review details showed the PR body as raw text, so GitHub markdown arrived as
literal ## and ** marks. The body now goes through the chat's MessageResponse
(GFM, sanitised, link-safe) in static mode, with remark-breaks matching GitHub's
single-newline line breaks and headings sized down to suit the card. It renders
only once Review details opens, and a huge body falls back to the chat's plain
text view (ChatMarkdown now exports isPathologicalText and PlainTextFallback).
